block head
    title Flatulence - Plants Cause Disease

block content
    h1 Flatulence
    p Definition by #[a(href="https://www.healthline.com/health/gas-flatulence") Healthline]:
    blockquote Also known as farting, passing wind, or having gas, flatulence is a medical term for releasing gas from the digestive system through the anus. It happens when gas collects inside the digestive system and is a normal process.
